  "bodyHash": "d2a0d12afc44c3f0",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1338/440/javaw_ocp2f9cnbu-copy.png\" alt=\"bg\" width=\"539\" height=\"539\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組將溫和的巨人——儒艮（又稱海牛）加入了遊戲中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以在河流中或海灘附近發現牠們悠閒地遊蕩。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">牠們的游泳速度緩慢，但受驚時會全力加速。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用海草與海藻來誘惑牠們。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果牠們在水中待的時間過長（約 5-10 分鐘）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">背部就會滋生不同種類的藻類，直到你幫牠們清理為止。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用海綿或刷子將藻類刷除。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">清理的過程中，牠們有時也會掉落卡在背上、於淺水區遊蕩時沾上的物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用海綿清理時不會損壞海綿。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在 Forge 環境中，你可以透過編輯 `data` → `biome tags` 與 `biome modifier` 資料夾內的 JSON 檔案，或使用資源包來調整此項及其他生成設定；Fabric 環境則提供專屬設定檔可供修改。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此外，`data` → `tags` → `item` 資料夾中也提供了 JSON 物品標籤檔案。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">藉此，你能自訂清理道具、普通／罕見／稀有掉落物，以及海牛的食物與誘發道具。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模組目前支援</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.4 | 1.19.2 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1458/184/638946510197549497.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">致謝：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">FAU Harbor Branch Oceanographic Institute - 儒艮鳴叫聲</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tom Hiddleston, Earthsounds</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>若你需要其他版本的模組，或在 CurseForge 上遭遇任何錯誤，請發送私人訊息給我。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上追蹤我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需安裝 AquariusLibs 才能運行</strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
